cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below."
title: "Autolabeler: automatic axon, basal and apical labeling of SWC neuron reconstructions"
abstract: >-
  A staged pipeline that labels every node of an SWC reconstruction as soma,
  axon, basal dendrite or apical dendrite, and flags the cells most likely to
  need expert review. Ships trained models for three seeds, an all-in-one
  variant over the same features, and the drivers that regenerate every number
  in the accompanying paper.
